    {
     "tipo": "dialogo",
     "titulo": "Dialogue: coordinating at work",
     "frases": [
      {
       "quien": {
        "texto": "林娜",
        "lengua": "estudio"
       },
       "estudio": "工作中遇到「工作、责任与会议」的问题，你会先跟谁商量？",
       "alumno": "If a problem related to «tasks, responsibilities and meetings» comes up at work, who would you talk to first?",
       "literal": "",
       "estructura": "",
       "nota": [],
       "analisis": [],
       "parrafo": 0
      },
      {
       "quien": {
        "texto": "王明",
        "lengua": "estudio"
       },
       "estudio": "我们可以先做一个简单的计划。",
       "alumno": "We can start with a simple plan.",
       "literal": "",
       "estructura": "",
       "nota": [],
       "analisis": [],
       "parrafo": 0
      },
      {
       "quien": {
        "texto": "林娜",
        "lengua": "estudio"
       },
       "estudio": "要是中间出了问题怎么办？",
       "alumno": "What if a problem comes up along the way?",
       "literal": "",
       "estructura": "",
       "nota": [],
       "analisis": [],
       "parrafo": 0
      },
      {
       "quien": {
        "texto": "王明",
        "lengua": "estudio"
       },
       "estudio": "到时候再调整，先把眼前的事情做好。",
       "alumno": "We'll adjust later; first let's do well what's in front of us.",
       "literal": "",
       "estructura": "",
       "nota": [],
       "analisis": [],
       "parrafo": 0
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "tipo": "texto",
     "titulo": "Reading: coordinating at work",
     "frases": [
      {
       "quien": {
        "texto": "",
        "lengua": "alumno"
       },
       "estudio": "处理工作中的「工作、责任与会议」，需要明确分工和时间安排。",
       "alumno": "Dealing with «tasks, responsibilities and meetings» at work requires clarifying the division of labour and timings.",
       "literal": "",
       "estructura": "",
       "nota": [],
       "analisis": [],
       "parrafo": 0
      },
      {
       "quien": {
        "texto": "",
        "lengua": "alumno"
       },
       "estudio": "遇到变化时，及时沟通通常比等到最后补救更有效。",
       "alumno": "When circumstances change, communicating in time is usually more effective than patching things up at the last minute.",
       "literal": "",
       "estructura": "",
       "nota": [],
       "analisis": [],
       "parrafo": 0
      },
      {
       "quien": {
        "texto": "",
        "lengua": "alumno"
       },
       "estudio": "如果条件发生变化，原来的决定也可以重新考虑。",
       "alumno": "If circumstances change, the original decision can also be reconsidered.",
       "literal": "",
       "estructura": "",
       "nota": [],
       "analisis": [],
       "parrafo": 0
      }
     ]
    }
   ]
